[[claim--ratov-functional-electrostimulation-emg-triggered-sport-specific]] attribute each
passage accordingly. The MACS/MICS "integrated theory" of
electrostimulation (4.2.1.4-4.2.1.5, citing Becker, Nordenstrom and Pilla on bioelectric
cell-signalling) is rated `contested`, with its mainstream-status judgment labelled
Inference, rather than presented as settled physiology;
see [[claim--macs-mics-integrated-theory-of-electrostimulation]]. Two forward/backward
